---
import { getRelativeLocaleUrl, getAbsoluteLocaleUrl } from 'astro:i18n';
import { getLangFromUrl, useTranslations, generateLocalePaths, generateLocaleUrls} from '../i18n/i18n';

const lang = getLangFromUrl(Astro.url);
const t = useTranslations(lang);
const localePaths = generateLocalePaths(Astro.url);
---

<div class="loading">
  <img class="loading_logo" src=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}logo_with_text_white.png`/>
</div>

<section class="top">
  <div class="top_bg" style={`background-image: url(${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}hero-sandankyo-gorge.jpeg)`}></div>
  <div class="overlay">
    <section class="page-0">
      <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(lang, `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}`)}>
        <img class="top_logo" src=`${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}logo_with_text_white.png`/>
      </a>
    </section>
    <section class="page-0-5">
      <div class="opening-info">
        <h3 class="opening-date">2026年11月14日開業</h3>
        <p class="opening-text">富士箱根伊豆国立公園内、135,500㎡の広大な自然に囲まれた地。</p>
        <p class="opening-text">かつて三井家の別荘が点在していたこの場所に、HOTEL THE MITSUI HAKONEが誕生します。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page-1">
      <div class="news-section">
        <h2 class="news-title">お知らせ</h2>
        <ul class="news-list">
          <li class="news-item">
            <span class="news-date">2026.09.01</span>
            <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(lang, `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}news/1`)} class="news-link">秋の特別プランのご案内</a>
          </li>
          <li class="news-item">
            <span class="news-date">2026.08.15</span>
            <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(lang, '${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}news/2')} class="news-link">夏季休業のお知らせ</a>
          </li>
          <li class="news-item">
            <span class="news-date">2026.07.20</span>
            <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(lang, '${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}news/3')} class="news-link">新しい客室がオープンしました</a>
          </li>
        </ul>
        <div class="news-more">
          <a href={getRelativeLocaleUrl(lang, `${import.meta.env.BASE_URL}news`)} class="news-more-link">お知らせ一覧を見る</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
    <section class="page-2">
      <div class="intro-text">
        <p>季節を感じ、土地を味わい、素材を嗜む。</p>
        <p>あるがままの自分を取り戻す、 無為自然に過ごす宿。</p>
        <br/>
        <p>都会の喧騒から離れ、</p>
        <p>緑に囲まれた海の一望できる奥座敷に</p>
        <p>SOKI ATAMIはあります。</p>
        <br/>
        <p>SOKIは、「素の器」を意味します。</p>
        <p>飾らずに、あるがままに過ごす時を受け入れる宿です。</p>
        <br/>
        <p>全てのお部屋に備えられた温泉で思い思いに寛ぎ、</p>
        <p>地元で採れた旬の食材を楽しみ、</p>
        <p>景色を眺めてほっとするひとときを。</p>
        <br/>
        <p>古くから湯治文化の根付く熱海で、</p>
        <p>現代に生きる私たちが、</p>
        <p>自分をいたわり養生できる滞在を。</p>
        <br/>
        <p>季節と風土に身を委ね、</p>
        <p>無為自然に過ごす時間をお楽しみください。</p>
      </div>
    </section>
  </div>
</section>

<script>
  const topSection = document.querySelector('.top');
  const logo = document.querySelector('.top_logo');
  const openingInfo = document.querySelector('.opening-info');

  topSection.addEventListener('scroll', () => {
    if (topSection.scrollTop > 0) {
      logo.classList.add('hidden');
      openingInfo.classList.add('visible');
    } else {
      logo.classList.remove('hidden');
      openingInfo.classList.remove('visible');
    }
  });


  const loading = document.querySelector('.loading');

  window.addEventListener('load', () => {
    setTimeout(() => {
      loading?.classList.add('fade-out');
    }, 1500);
  });
</script>

<style>
  @media screen and (min-width: 1025px) {
    .loading {
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      background-color: #000;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      z-index: 500;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      transition: opacity 1.0s ease;
    }

    .loading.fade-out {
      opacity: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .loading_logo {
      width: 180px;
      z-index: 510;
    }

    .top {
      width: 100vw;
      height: 100vh;
      position: relative;
      overflow-y: auto;
    }

    .top_bg {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      position: fixed;
      top: 0;
      left: 0;
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      z-index: 0;
      pointer-events: none;
    }

    .overlay {
      width: 100%;
      min-height: 100vh;
      position: relative;
      z-index: 1;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-start;
    }

    .top_text {
      color: #fff;
      font-size: 50px;
    }

    .top_logo {
      position: absolute;
      width: 80px;
      margin-top: 15px;
      margin-left: 30px;
      top: 0px;
      left: 0px;
      transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
    }

    .top_logo.hidden {
      opacity: 0;
    }

    .page-0 {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100vh;
    }

    .page-0-5 {
      width: 100%;
      height: 50vh;
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      padding: 60px 80px 100px;
    }

    .opening-info {
      color: #fff;
      text-align: left;
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.5s ease;
    }

    .opening-info.visible {
      opacity: 1;
    }

    .opening-date {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 30px;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    .opening-text {
      font-size: 14px;
      line-height: 2;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .page-1 {
      width: 100%;
      height: auto;
      background-color: rgb(0,0,0,0.5);
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 60px 40px;
    }

    .news-section {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      color: #fff;
    }

    .news-title {
      font-size: 32px;
      letter-spacing: 8px;
      margin-bottom: 40px;
      text-align: center;
      font-weight: normal;
    }

    .news-list {
      list-style: none;
      padding: 0;
      margin: 0 0 40px 0;
    }

    .news-item {
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);
      padding: 20px 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 20px;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }

    .news-item:hover {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .news-date {
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.8);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .news-link {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 16px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      flex: 1;
    }

    .news-more {
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 30px;
    }

    .news-more-link {
      color: #fff;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 14px;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
      padding-bottom: 5px;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #fff;
      transition: opacity 0.3s;
    }

    .news-more-link:hover {
      opacity: 0.7;
    }

    .page-2 {
      width: 100%;
      height: 100vh;
      background-color: transparent;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: center;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 60px 40px;
    }

    .intro-text {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 800px;
      color: #fff;
      margin-right: auto;
      margin-left: 20%;
    }

    .intro-text p {
      font-size: 16px;
      line-height: 2;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
      text-align: left;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .intro-text br {
      display: block;
      content: "";
      margin-top: 20px;
    }
  }
</style>
